= German Retreat

The last group of starving and freezing German soldiers surrendered to the Soviet army, and the Battle of Stalingrad ended in a Soviet victory.

The Axis powers’ aggressive momentum had been reversed, and it seemed that victory in the anti-fascist war would also come in the near future. Hope Korea will likewise gain liberation in the not-too-distant future.
